[2025-10-22 20:45:25.232148] STATS: Encoding/Decoding Formulas:
[2025-10-22 20:45:25.232149] STATS: 
[2025-10-22 20:45:25.232150] STATS: ENCODING: S → class_id
[2025-10-22 20:45:25.232151] STATS:   1. Sort speaker IDs: S' = sorted(S)
[2025-10-22 20:45:25.232152] STATS:   2. Find lexicographic index of S'
[2025-10-22 20:45:25.232153] STATS: 
[2025-10-22 20:45:25.232154] STATS: DECODING: class_id → S
[2025-10-22 20:45:25.232155] STATS:   1. Find k: Σ(j=0 to k-1) C(5,j) ≤ class_id < Σ(j=0 to k) C(5,j)
[2025-10-22 20:45:25.232156] STATS:   2. Reconstruct combination from remaining index
[2025-10-22 20:45:25.232157] STATS: 
